8: # Style System Specification
9: 
10: ## Overview
11: 
12: The Style System in CycoTui provides a comprehensive approach for styling terminal UI elements with colors, text attributes, and other visual properties. Based on analysis of Ratatui's style implementation, this specification defines how CycoTui will handle styling across different terminal capabilities.
13: 
14: The style system focuses on providing two main approaches:
15: 1. **Explicit Style Struct**: Creating and using Style objects (e.g., `Style.New().Fg(Color.Red)`)
16: 2. **Style Shorthands**: Fluent extension methods (e.g., `"hello".Red().Bold()`)
17: 
18: ## Scope
19: 
20: This specification covers:
21: 
22: 1. Style struct definition and behavior
23: 2. Text modifier flags and combinations
24: 3. Color models and color handling
25: 4. Style composition and merging (patching)
26: 5. Fluent API patterns and extension methods
27: 6. Platform-specific adaptations
28: 7. Optional feature handling
29: 
30: ## Requirements
31: 
32: ### Style Struct Definition
33: 
34: The core `Style` struct must provide:
35: 
36: ```csharp
37: public readonly struct Style
38: {
39:     public Color? Foreground { get; }
40:     public Color? Background { get; }
41:     public Color? UnderlineColor { get; } // Optional feature
42:     public TextModifier AddModifier { get; }
43:     public TextModifier SubModifier { get; }
44:     
45:     // Constructors
46:     public static Style New() { }
47:     public static Style Reset() { }
48:     
49:     // Color methods
50:     public Style Fg(Color color) { }
51:     public Style Bg(Color color) { }
52:     public Style UnderlineColor(Color color) { } // Optional feature
53:     
54:     // Modifier methods
55:     public Style Bold() { }
56:     public Style Italic() { }
57:     public Style Underlined() { }
58:     // ... other modifiers
59:     
60:     // Style composition
61:     public Style Patch(Style other) { }
62: }
63: ```
64: 
65: ### Color System Integration
66: 
67: Based on analysis of `ratatui-core/src/style/color.rs` and `ratatui-core/src/style/palette.rs`, the style system must provide comprehensive color support including predefined palettes:
68: 
69: #### Color Enum Definition
70: ```csharp
